	quest.00C7BD5A5443E2F4.quest_desc: ["&7Functions the same as a vanilla &#66CCFFaxe&7. You can place a vanilla &#66CCFFaxe&7 in a crafting table to convert it into a &#66DDCCSilent Gear Axe&7."]
	quest.00C7BD5A5443E2F4.quest_subtitle: "The Standard Wood-\"Chopping\" Tool"
	quest.0108AD0A0C6B606D.quest_desc: [
		"&7Right-click to hurl a giant &#FFD700anchor&7 at enemies. Sneak-right-click to summon a &#66CCFFtide&7 around you."
		""
		"&7Throw damage = &cmelee damage&7."
		"&7Tide damage = &cmelee damage × 0.8&7, &c4&7 waves total."
		""
		"&7Cooldown is dynamically determined by &6Silent Gear's&7 &eattack speed&7 attribute. Higher attack speed means shorter cooldown."
