	]
	quest.0167D4BEB8E8FB00.quest_subtitle: "As the saying goes, you are what you eat"
	quest.017488D14BA19FAA.quest_desc: [
		"&7This modpack supports searching material traits and part types in &#FFD700EMI&7."
		"{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"• Type\",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"%trait name\",\"color\":\"green\"},{\"text\":\" (e.g.\",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"%toughness\",\"color\":\"green\"},{\"text\":\") to find all materials with this trait\",\"color\":\"gray\"}]}"
		"{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"• Type\",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"&part type\",\"color\":\"green\"},{\"text\":\" (e.g.\",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"&main part\",\"color\":\"green\"},{\"text\":\" or\",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"&main\",\"color\":\"green\"},{\"text\":\") to find materials usable for this part type\",\"color\":\"gray\"}]}"
		""
		"Of course, you can also just search directly."
		"In RS you should be able to search trait names or part names directly."
		""
		"&7Most materials in this modpack now have stage level displays. You can search &#66FF66\"stage x\"&7 directly in &#FFD700EMI&7 to view materials of &#FFAA33stage x&7.  "
		"&7Stages are mostly determined by the material's era. &#FF6666This does not mean you can only obtain the next stage's items during stage x.&7  "
		""
		"&7I know the guidance is pretty bad... but I can't write quests, no way around it... working on it, bitter. "
	]
	quest.017488D14BA19FAA.quest_subtitle: "The modpack has made many optimizations and tweaks to Silent Gear"
	quest.017488D14BA19FAA.title: "Make Good Use of EMI"
	quest.017E000317AA737C.quest_desc: [
		"&7Right-click to summon a flying sword with &#66CCFFindependent invincibility frames&7. The sword's damage depends on the stats at the time of summoning (must be re-summoned when attributes change)."
		""
